			"Message": "chore(deps): Update dependencies in Cargo.toml\n\nThis commit updates multiple dependencies in the Cargo.toml file to their latest versions. The primary goal is to keep the project up-to-date with the latest improvements, bug fixes, and security patches from the community.\n\nUpdated dependencies include:\n- anyhow: 1.0.98 -> 1.0.100\n- chrono: 0.4.41 -> 0.4.43\n- clap: 4.5.40 -> 4.5.54\n- git2: 0.20.2 -> 0.20.3\n- globset: 0.4.16 -> 0.4.18\n- notify: 8.1.0 -> 8.2.0\n- rayon: 1.10.0 -> 1.11.0\n- regex: 1.11.1 -> 1.12.2\n- serde: 1.0.219 -> 1.0.228\n- serde_json: 1.0.140 -> 1.0.149\n- swc_common: 13.0.4 -> 18.0.1\n- swc_ecma_ast: 13.0.1 -> 20.0.0\n- swc_ecma_codegen: 15.0.2 -> 22.0.0\n- swc_ecma_parser: 19.0.0 -> 33.0.0\n- swc_ecma_transforms_base: 20.0.0 -> 36.0.0\n- swc_ecma_transforms_proposal: 20.0.0 -> 36.0.0\n- swc_ecma_transforms_typescript: 22.0.0 -> 39.0.0\n- swc_ecma_visit: 13.0.0 -> 20.0.0\n- tokio: 1.46.1 -> 1.49.0\n- tracing: 0.1.41 -> 0.1.44\n- tracing-subscriber: 0.3.19 -> 0.3.22\n- build-dependencies serde: 1.0.219 -> 1.0.228\n- build-dependencies toml: 0.9.0 -> 0.9.11",
